# Invariants

Enforce invariants in domain methods with `InvalidInputError`. Do not expose the backing list.

```csharp
/// <summary>
/// Добавляет этап в коллекцию страницы.
/// </summary>
public void AddStage(PageStage stage)
{
    if (_stages.Any(s => s.Stage == stage.Stage))
        throw new InvalidInputError("Этап уже добавлен");

    stage.AttachToPage(Id);
    _stages.Add(stage);
}
```

Group the checks for a business action inside its named operation. In the example above, the aggregate enforces stage uniqueness before changing its collection. Extract a separate policy when several operations genuinely share the decision.
